  "description": "World War III has ended, but Ji-Min’s troubles are only beginning. A superhuman bloomer, he’s enslaved in a scrapyard, where his life changes after he finds and repairs Aurora, a discarded battle bot. Post-war exploitation of the weak and clashing factions has given rise to the Second Lost Generation. Even if they escape, they’ll still have to grow up in the chaos. But can they outrun the Stalker Bot and the mercenaries hot on their trail?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
